{"nodes": [{"id": "readme_tiered_isolation", "label": "Tiered isolation (container/gVisor/microVM)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "README.md:16", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Isolation is a pluggable, advertised, buyer-selectable property of a node. A node reports the strongest tier it can deliver (probe at startup); a buyer sets minIsolation; the registry never places below it and a contributor never silently downgrades."}, {"id": "readme_sandbox_backend_interface", "label": "Pluggable SandboxBackend", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "README.md:49", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The daemon talks to a sandbox only through SandboxBackend (probe/create/destroy/list), so docker, gvisor, kata-fc and firecracker are drop-in backends selected by SANDBOX_BACKEND."}, {"id": "readme_fail_loud_no_downgrade", "label": "Never advertise a tier you can't deliver", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "README.md:17", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "If the configured backend is unavailable at startup the daemon refuses to register rather than falling back to a weaker tier \u2014 a node's advertised tier is always one it can actually provide."}, {"id": "readme_key_only_ssh", "label": "Key-only SSH by default", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "README.md:180", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The buyer supplies a public key (web pastes; agent generates ed25519); the sandbox runs PasswordAuthentication no. The guessable wallet-address password returns only behind ALLOW_PASSWORD_SSH=true."}, {"id": "readme_egress_firewall", "label": "Per-lease egress firewall", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "README.md:184", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "EGRESS_MODE (allowlist default) applies a per-lease nftables ruleset: default-drop, DNS to the resolver only, buyer allowlist, drop cloud metadata + RFC1918. Blocks the mine/scan/spam/DDoS abuse that isolation alone does nothing about."}, {"id": "readme_abuse_suspend", "label": "Egress-abuse suspension + kill switch", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "README.md:188", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The daemon reports per-lease drop counters on heartbeat; a buyer past EGRESS_DROP_LIMIT is suspended and torn down. A local kill switch destroys every sandbox + its rules at once."}, {"id": "readme_teardown_guarantee", "label": "Teardown guarantee (guest TTL + reaper)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "README.md:191", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Leases live in memory, so a VM could outlive the registry and burn a contributor's machine. The guest self-powers-off at a hard TTL and a host reaper reconciles live sandboxes against known leases every REAP_INTERVAL_MS."}], "edges": [{"source": "readme_tiered_isolation", "target": "shared_types_isolationtier", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "README.md:16", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "readme_tiered_isolation", "target": "shared_types_satisfiestier", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "README.md:17", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "readme_sandbox_backend_interface", "target": "sandbox_types_sandboxbackend", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "README.md:49", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "readme_sandbox_backend_interface", "target": "sandbox_index_selectbackend", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "README.md:49", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "readme_sandbox_backend_interface", "target": "sandbox_docker_dockerbackend", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "README.md:49", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "readme_sandbox_backend_interface", "target": "sandbox_gvisor_gvisorbackend", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "README.md:49", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "readme_sandbox_backend_interface", "target": "sandbox_kata_fc_katafirecrackerbackend", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "README.md:49", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "readme_sandbox_backend_interface", "target": "sandbox_firecracker_firecrackerbackend", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "README.md:49", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "readme_fail_loud_no_downgrade", "target": "sandbox_index_selectbackend", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "README.md:17", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "readme_fail_loud_no_downgrade", "target": "sandbox_probe_probebackends", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.85, "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "README.md:17", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "readme_key_only_ssh", "target": "shared_types_issshpublickey", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.85, "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "README.md:180", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "readme_egress_firewall", "target": "net_nft_buildnftruleset", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "README.md:184", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "readme_egress_firewall", "target": "net_nft_applyegress", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "README.md:184", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "readme_abuse_suspend", "target": "net_nft_readdropcounter", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.85, "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "README.md:188", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "readme_teardown_guarantee", "target": "sandbox_reaper_reap", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "README.md:191", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "readme_teardown_guarantee", "target": "src_index_reapnow", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "README.md:191", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "readme_tiered_isolation", "target": "docs_microvm_setup_kvm_requirement", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "README.md:26", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "readme_key_only_ssh", "target": "docs_daemon_isolation_socket_root", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.75, "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "README.md:182", "weight": 1.0}], "hyperedges": [{"id": "isolation_tiers_group", "label": "The three isolation backends", "nodes": ["sandbox_docker_dockerbackend", "sandbox_gvisor_gvisorbackend", "sandbox_kata_fc_katafirecrackerbackend", "sandbox_firecracker_firecrackerbackend"], "relation": "implement", "confidence": "EXTR